00:05:23.823 --> 00:05:25.591
and apparently has some new revelations

00:05:25.591 --> 00:05:28.761
in the in the Jimmy Tammy Baker scandal.

00:05:28.895 --> 00:05:31.130
I wonder how you think or perceive

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:34.801
